{"id":"en_seal-unbound-back-to-power","title":"Seal Unbound, Back to Power","titleEn":"Seal Unbound, Back to Power","description":"Maleficent uses her gaze to imprison 200,000 orcs, saving Arlant before falling into a deep sleep. When she awakens two decades later, she learns the king violated his promise and slaughtered the elves. Diana and Selena subject her to brutal torture, tearing away her scales and pouring molten gold over her. After Diana destroys the seal, the orcs are set loose. Maleficent transforms into a dragon and observes their defeat. Together with Ilian, she sets out to find whoever truly abducted the elves.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/seal-unbound-back-to-power/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/seal-unbound-back-to-power/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fantasy","Karma Payback","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdgm4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_seal-unbound-back-to-power_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdgm4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_seal-unbound-back-to-power_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdgm4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_seal-unbound-back-to-power_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdgm4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_seal-unbound-back-to-power_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdgm4/?pub=4occak","kind